# Generated run output -- the evidence a run happened, not source.
results/

# NO LOCKFILE IS COMMITTED, DELIBERATELY, AND THIS IS TEMPORARY.
#
# This repo is developed on a machine whose npm registry is a corporate mirror.
# The mirror REWRITES every resolution line in pnpm-lock.yaml to internal,
# authenticated hosts. Committing that here would publish internal infrastructure
# details in a public repo and hand every outside contributor a lockfile pointing
# at hosts they cannot reach.
#
# The fix is to generate the lockfile somewhere that reaches public npm -- this
# repo's own CI runner does -- and commit that. Until then no lockfile is better
# than a poisoned one. There are five dependencies; a fresh resolve is cheap.
pnpm-lock.yaml
